貯蔵品)の収益性の低下が認められ、売上原価へ棚卸資産の簿価切下げ額1,701百万円(売上原価の増加)の計上見込みとなりました。そのため、当第２四半期連結累計期間の差し引きでは、棚卸資産の簿価切下げ額1,308百万円の計上見込みとなりました。●営業外収益(持分法による投資利益)の内容　主にフィリピンの持分法適用関連会社において、堅調な需要に支えられ、第１四半期連結累計期間で計上済みの1,002百万円に加え、第２四半期連結会計期間において3,670百万円計上見込みとなり、当第２四半期連結累計期間では持分法による投資利益4,672百万円を計上する見込みとなりました。", null, "CurrentYearInstant"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 5356000000, "5,356", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -3983000000, "3,983", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -754000000, "754", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -958000000, "958", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -55.1, "55.10", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["売上高", "NetSales", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 5449000000, "5,449", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["営業利益", "OperatingIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", -4009000000, "4,009", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["経常利益", "OrdinaryIncome", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 957000000, "957", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "ProfitAttributableToOwnersOfParent", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 645000000, "645", "JPY", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["NetIncomePerShare", "NetIncomePerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 37.13, "37.13", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentAccumulatedQ2Duration_ConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["AmountChangeNetSal